OL,3,GNEWSANew school and nursery approved
OL,4,Afor new town
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new school and nursery with places
OL,7,Ffor more than 700 children has been
OL,8,Fgiven the go-ahead by planners.
OL,10,FThe primary school on the edge of
OL,11,FCranbrook, a new town near Exeter,
OL,12,FDevon, is due to have space for 630
OL,13,Fpupils, with 80 nursery places
OL,14,Favailable.
OL,16,FThe site, Cobdens Primary School, would
OL,17,Falso have a grass sports field and an
OL,18,Fall-weather floodlit artificial pitch
OL,19,Fthat would be available for community
OL,20,Fuse, scheme proposers said.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
