OL,3,GNEWSANew school and nursery approved
OL,4,Afor new town
OL,5,
OL,6,FOfficers at East Devon District Council
OL,7,Fhad expressed concern about the
OL,8,Flandscaping around the site and the
OL,9,Fappearance of the building, but
OL,10,Famendments to the plans led to it being
OL,11,Ffully approved.
